  <name>Wetterblick</name>
  <summary>Rain radar with a 2-hour forecast</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Wetterblick shows the rain radar for Germany on a map, animated from
      the past hour to two hours ahead, based on the radar nowcast that
      the Deutscher Wetterdienst publishes as open data.
    </p>
    <p>
      Wetterblick is an independent project and not affiliated with the
      Deutscher Wetterdienst. Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors.
    </p>
  </description>
  <developer id="de.nexumia">
